From 51f4339ad90d7073d26cd58220f3392186ec9113 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:09:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(od-sevev): palette v3 colour map for code, the
 applier, and the shell in blue and white

- art/od-sevev/palette-v3-map.json: 17 chrome colours old -> new, with roles,
  the colours deliberately left alone, and the file:line sites (28 literals on
  26 lines in 13 game/scripts files; not applied here, the mobile-first
  rewrite is in flight).
- tools/apply_palette_map.py: dry run by default, --write, --check, --scan,
  --refresh-notes; rewrites "#rrggbb[aa]" and GDScript float Color(r, g, b[, a])
  literals within 1/255 of a mapped colour, alpha kept.
- game/web/shell.html: map applied (theme-color, page, the gate, About, the
  phone frame), a white-over-flag rule heading the gate and About, and the
  load bar's fill moved to flag_hi for 3.5:1 on its track.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JZ6f2h5tcXVKGAwuAga5z8
---
 art/od-sevev/palette-v3-map.json | 111 +++++++++++++++++++
 game/web/shell.html              |  42 +++----
 tools/apply_palette_map.py       | 183 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 317 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 art/od-sevev/palette-v3-map.json
